          <div class="chip warn" style="margin:0 0 8px;">Reviewed Paleocoordinates Pending</div>
          <div style="font-family:'Spectral SC',serif; font-size:11px; color:#7a6647;">Target age: 68.0 Ma · needs reviewed PBDB / GPlates import</div>
